### TEST READ & INVENTORY ENDPOINTS[cite: 5]


### Get All Products (Type: Public)[cite: 5]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Search Products (Type: Public)[cite: 5]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?query=Chocolate
Accept: application/json

### Get Low Stock Inventory (Type: Admin)[cite: 5]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/low-stock
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Category Statistics (Type: Admin)[cite: 5]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get Frontpage Site Config (Type: Public)[cite: 5]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/site-config/frontpage
Accept: application/json
